@startuml dlq-flow
title Повторная публикация из DLQ (набросок)

scale 0.72
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 14
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #444444

skinparam rectangle<<main>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
}
skinparam rectangle<<dlq>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFEBEE
}
skinparam rectangle<<tool>> {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
}

rectangle "Kafka\n**transactions.events.dlq**" <<dlq>> as DLQ
rectangle "**Утилита**\n`cmd/dlqreplay`\n----\n1) **FetchMessage** из DLQ\n   (group `diploma-dlq-replay-tool`)\n2) **DLQMessage** → payload,\n   ключ **user_id** как в API\n3) **WriteMessages** → основной топик\n4) **CommitMessages** в DLQ\n----\n**-limit** · **-dry-run**" <<tool>> as REP
rectangle "Kafka\n**transactions.events**" <<main>> as EVT

DLQ -[#C62828]right-> REP : **чтение** DLQ
REP -[#2E7D32]right-> EVT : **публикация**\nисходного payload\n(`transaction.created`)
REP .[#1565C0]> DLQ : **CommitMessages**\nпрогресс чтения DLQ

@enduml
